{
  "$comment": "Health bands for localAIStack's personal_health_baseline, re-based on the families the HealthKit bridge actually delivers (HEALTH_INTEGRATION_ROADMAP T8). Scope is dynamic: a band has a slot only while its hkType is in scope on the PE (INGEST_CONTRACT.md, Scope and resync). Raw-unit thresholds; values are de-normalized with each axis's sourceRange, which must match localHealthkitBridge docs/lane-semantics.json (checked by test_health_bands.py, T7). Each axis grades ok if its value satisfies `ok`, else watch if it satisfies `watch`, else concern; a condition is any of gte/gt/lte/lt, all of which must hold. So `watch` can be the outer band around `ok`. A band grades as its worst axis. The watch zones are provisional.",
